
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#f8f3ee">
  <title>For Someone Special ♡</title>

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      padding: 24px 16px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      background: #f8f3ee;
      color: #594b45;
      font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    }

    .container {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 410px;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 34px 25px;
      border: 1px solid #eaded6;
      border-radius: 22px;
      background: #fffcf9;
      box-shadow: 0 12px 40px #6c50440d;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 10px;
      letter-spacing: 4px;
      color: #a88c7e;
    }

    .heart {
      margin: 25px 0 10px;
      color: #c58d98;
      font-size: 43px;
      animation: heartbeat 2s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    h1 {
      font-weight: normal;
      font-size: clamp(30px, 8vw, 42px);
      line-height: 1.2;
      margin: 12px 0;
    }

    .intro {
      color: #89776e;
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.9;
      margin: 15px 0 25px;
    }

    button {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 13px;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      padding: 14px 23px;
      border: 1px solid #c58d98;
      border-radius: 30px;
      background: #c58d98;
      color: white;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: 0.25s ease;
    }

    button:active {
      transform: scale(0.97);
    }

    .letter {
      margin-top: 27px;
      padding: 23px 18px;
      border-top: 1px solid #eaded6;
      background: #faf5f0;
      border-radius: 14px;
      text-align: left;
      animation: appear 0.6s ease;
    }

    .letter h2 {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: normal;
      color: #a46f7b;
    }

    .letter p {
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.95;
    }

    .signature {
      text-align: right;
      color: #a46f7b;
      font-style: italic;
    }

    .hidden {
      display: none;
    }

    .footer {
      margin-top: 28px;
      color: #b09b90;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 10px;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
    }

    @keyframes heartbeat {
      0%, 100% {
        transform: scale(1);
      }

      50% {
        transform: scale(1.1);
      }
    }

    @keyframes appear {
      from {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(10px);
      }

      to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
      }
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      *, *::before, *::after {
        animation: none !important;
        transition: none !important;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <main class="container">

    <div class="eyebrow">
      A LITTLE NOTE FOR YOU
    </div>

    <div class="heart" aria-hidden="true">♡</div>

    <h1>For someone special.</h1>

    <p class="intro">
      Some feelings deserve more than a text message.
      <br>
      So, I made you something.
    </p>

    <button
      id="openButton"
      type="button"
      aria-expanded="false"
      aria-controls="loveLetter"
    >
      Open your letter ♡
    </button>

    <section id="loveLetter" class="letter hidden">

      <h2>My love,</h2>

      <p>
        If I could put everything I feel for you into words,
        I would probably still find a thousand more things to say.
      </p>

      <p>
        I love the little things about us, the conversations,
        the laughter, and the moments that remind me how special
        it is to have you in my life.
      </p>

      <p>
        I hope you never forget that you matter to me.
        You don't have to be perfect, have all the answers,
        or have everything figured out. I appreciate you
        for who you are.
      </p>

      <p>
        And if there is one thing I want you to take away
        from this little letter, it is this:
        <strong>I love you, and I'm grateful for you.</strong>
      </p>

      <p class="signature">
        Always with love, ♡
        <br>
        Your favourite person
      </p>

      <button id="closeButton" type="button">
        Close letter ♡
      </button>

    </section>

    <div class="footer">
      MADE WITH LOVE · JUST FOR YOU
    </div>

  </main>

  <script>
    const openButton =
      document.getElementById("openButton");

    const closeButton =
      document.getElementById("closeButton");

    const loveLetter =
      document.getElementById("loveLetter");

    openButton.addEventListener("click", function () {
      loveLetter.classList.remove("hidden");
      openButton.classList.add("hidden");
      openButton.setAttribute("aria-expanded", "true");
    });

    closeButton.addEventListener("click", function () {
      loveLetter.classList.add("hidden");
      openButton.classList.remove("hidden");
      openButton.setAttribute("aria-expanded", "false");
      openButton.focus();
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>
